  "one round trip every held session: the result is only as good as the assumption that auction orders receive the printed open and close",
  "1.6 of VTI's 5.4 bps a session of holdout overnight return is a difference from SPY that its intraday leg gives back (-1.7 bps; same-day close-to-close difference -0.12 bps). That is a print-location effect: it pays only if auction orders receive the printed open and close",
